{
  "id": "paldea-evolved-build-battle-box",
  "name": "Paldea Evolved Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Paldea Evolved prerelease tournaments and sold by shops in the Prerelease Program from 26 May 2023. Each box held four Paldea Evolved booster packs and a 40-card deck built around one of four promos with the Paldea Evolved logo. The decks also held non-holo copies of Lokix, Baxcalibur, Tinkaton and Boss's Orders, which booster packs have only in holofoil, and both non-holo Professor's Research cards of Scarlet & Violet, Professor Sada's and Professor Turo's.",
